{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網絡熱傳一段車Cam短片，直擊油麻地彌敦道有兩名男子駕駛電動單車分別於左右兩線行駛，期間中線警車發現左線車輛涉嫌違規即時將其截停，惟右線的電動單車卻趁亂右轉離開，過程引發全網熱議。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-25-10h34m23s331.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026s4lPTN88JR1790304086.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-25-10h34m23s331.png\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">從流傳的片段所見，事發地點為油麻地彌敦道，當時右線有一名男子駕駛電動單車，中線行駛着一輛警車，而左線另有一名男子同樣駕駛電動單車。警員疑發現左線有人違例駕駛電動單車，隨即上前採取行動將其截停，右線的電動單車駕駛者趁機右轉駛離現場。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-25-10h36m03s947.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20260O85PG9VvZ1790304100.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-25-10h36m03s947.png\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">這段影片隨即引起大批網民熱烈討論，不少人對於違例駕駛電動單車者的膽量感到震驚，指現時相關違規情況十分猖狂，紛紛留言笑指：「咁都畀你走到」、「大地任我街」、「你都交啲戲扮踩吓呀大佬」、「真係猖狂。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-25T03:18:48.892891+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":305,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}